## 🌐 Domain Entity Creation

A new investigation was created in Maltego and a **Domain entity** was added to the investigation graph.

The target domain was entered into the entity and used as the **starting point for the footprinting investigation**.

This allowed the domain to be investigated for relationships with other publicly available information.

