## 🔍 Domain Footprinting

The created **Domain entity** was investigated using Maltego's available **transforms**.

The investigation expanded the domain into related entities and displayed the discovered information within the Maltego graph.

The transform-based investigation was used to identify information associated with the domain, including **related email addresses**.

